<p>A furious ice storm rages around the user doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">42, 55, 64, 72, 79</acronym> cold damage in a radius of 3 each turn for 4 turns.</p><p>It has 25% chance to freeze damaged targets.</p><p>The damage and duration will increase with your Willpower.</p>